+++ b/web/README.md
@@ -1,6 +1,16 @@
+## Prerequisites
+
+- **Node.js 18.x LTS** (18.20.4 recommended)
+  - **Important:** Node.js 20+ is NOT supported due to compatibility issues with build dependencies
+  - Use `nvm` to manage Node.js versions: `nvm use 18` or `nvm install 18.20.4`
+  - An `.nvmrc` file is provided for automatic version selection
+
 ## Install front-end dependencies
 
    ```bash
+   # Verify Node.js version first
+   node --version  # Should show v18.x.x
+
    npm install
    ```
 
